      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk, \"something else\" just sounds like more of the same. it's not just a block, its like the core is gone. everyone i know is waiting for me to fail or just fade away into being some mediocre guy who used to be talented. it feels like the only way to keep any dignity left is to just... end the story here. before i become a total embarrassment.",
